# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Herbalism 50-100
section Herbalism 50-100

step Journeyman Herbalism
  tip Journeyman Herbalism raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction. Incense Candle, Forever's camping item for Herbalism, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: Herbalism): a Peacebloom and a Silverleaf each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour.
  train Herbalism Journeyman
  learn 1229705

step Earthroot & Mageroyal: Westfall (50-70)
  only Human,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Westfall
  tip Walk the loop and pick every Peacebloom (1, yellow), Silverleaf (1, yellow), Earthroot (15, yellow), Mageroyal (50, orange) on the way until Herbalism 70. Mageroyal and Briarthorn sometimes give a Swiftthistle as well. The loop asks level 15: no creature on it is more than a level above that, and it keeps clear of the other faction's towns. A lap is about 1,200 yards, 3 minutes with the stops; the arrow leads stop to stop. Expect about 40 herbs for these 20 points: about 35 Earthroot, 20 Mageroyal, 15 Peacebloom, 15 Silverleaf and 5 Swiftthistle. For Alchemy: about 75 Mageroyal, 110 Peacebloom and 80 Silverleaf in all.
  level 15
  loop
  goto 39.6,32.9 "Mageroyal, Earthroot" r 60
  goto 43.0,29.7 "Mageroyal" r 60
  goto 46.1,28.7 "Earthroot, Peacebloom" r 60
  goto 42.2,33.1 "Earthroot, Peacebloom" r 60
  goto 42.8,38.8 "Silverleaf, Mageroyal" r 60
  goto 38.9,38.4 "Earthroot, Mageroyal" r 60
  goto 37.0,32.8 "Silverleaf, Mageroyal" r 60
  goto 36.6,26.5 "Mageroyal" r 60
  skill Herbalism 70

